  "description": "USN-9075-1 fixed a vulnerability in libjwt. Unfortunately, the update\nbuilt the OpenSSL version of libjwt with the wrong library name, which\ncaused applications using it to fail to start. The update also left the\nfix for CVE-2024-25189 incomplete in that version. This update fixes the\nproblems.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience.\n\nOriginal advisory details:\n\n It was discovered that libjwt did not use a constant-time comparison when\n verifying HMAC signatures. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue\n to forge signatures through a timing side-channel attack and bypass\n authentication.\n",
